cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "MapleStats MCP"
message: >-
  If you use MapleStats MCP in research, cite the software and record the
  release or commit used. Cite each underlying dataset separately using
  its publisher's attribution requirements.
authors:
  - family-names: "Sánchez Pazmiño"
    given-names: "Daniel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dsanchezp18/maplestats-mcp"
url: "https://maplestats.danielstats.io/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  MapleStats MCP provides access to Canadian public statistics and open
  data through the Model Context Protocol. It combines source-specific
  data retrieval with bilingual tool discovery, source metadata and
  reproducible analytical workflows.
keywords:
  - "Canadian public data"
  - "official statistics"
  - "Model Context Protocol"
  - "reproducible research"
